  "controlPatch": "In an uninstalled copy only, after original admission and mandatory P01 baseline construction, semantic selection returns that baseline before the M2 transformation portfolio. Hard image admission remains checked.",
  "limitations": "Output identity supports reuse of runtime image measurements. Compiler construction costs remain separate; this does not qualify timing or final integration.",
  "patch": "--- a/src/data/closed_compilation.zig\n+++ b/src/data/closed_compilation.zig\n@@ -289,6 +289,14 @@\n     stats.original_bytes = try image.encodedLength(original);\n     stats.baseline_bytes = try image.encodedLength(baseline.program);\n     stats.final_bytes = stats.baseline_bytes;\n+    // UNINSTALLED TEST CONTROL: same semantic selection and mandatory P01;\n+    // omit the investigated M2 transformation/search portfolio (spec section 9.1).\n+    if (options.contract == .semantic) {\n+        try allowBaseline(options, stats.baseline_bytes);\n+        stats.outcome = .no_change;\n+        keep_baseline = true;\n+        return baseline;\n+    }\n     if (options.contract == .structural) {\n         if (options.max_image_bytes) |limit| if (stats.final_bytes > limit) return error.Capacity;\n         stats.outcome = .structural;\n"
